 Solution: def sum_div(number):
    if number <= 0:
        return 0
    total = 0
    i = 1
    while i * i <= number:
        if number % i == 0:
            total += i
            if i != number // i:
                total += number // i
        i += 1
    return total.
 Test: def check():
    assert sum_div(8)==7
    assert sum_div(12)==16
    assert sum_div(7)==1

