 Solution: def find_length(string):
    max_diff = 0
    current_diff = 0
    prefix_sums = {0: -1}
    for (i, ch) in enumerate(string):
        if ch == '0':
            current_diff += 1
        else:
            current_diff -= 1
        if current_diff in prefix_sums:
            max_diff = max(max_diff, i - prefix_sums[current_diff])
        else:
            prefix_sums[current_diff] = i
    return max_diff.
 Test: def check():
    assert find_length("11000010001") == 6
    assert find_length("10111") == 1
    assert find_length("11011101100101") == 2

