 Solution: def get_max_sum(n):
    memo = {}

    def dfs(n):
        if n == 0:
            return 0
        if n in memo:
            return memo[n]
        value = n
        value += dfs(n // 2) + dfs(n // 3) + dfs(n // 4) + dfs(n // 5)
        memo[n] = max(memo.get(n, 0), value)
        return memo[n]
    return dfs(n).
 Test: def check():
